# Change discipline

- Do **only** what was asked — no drive-by refactors, renames, or “while we’re here” cleanups
- Prefer extending an existing module over adding a new abstraction or folder
- Match naming, layout, and patterns already used in the touched service
- Do not add dependencies, docs, or config unless required for the task
- One concern per change set (one service / one feature slice / one migration)
- Never cross microservice boundaries via internal imports — use APIs/contracts
- If requirements are ambiguous, ask before inventing architecture

```text
✅ GOOD — add route + schema + test in ai/
❌ BAD  — rewrite unrelated agents, add Redis, invent a shared framework
```
